    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "3\n••.\nOZARK\n10000\nN970Z",
      "Serving Mid-America Best\nThe New OZARK DC-9\nby Douglas\nThe new silhouette is no longer a shape of\nthings to come. It's here and ready to streak\nacross the routes of Ozark... making every\nroute a jet route. The DC-9, with a cruising\nspeed of 560 miles per hour, shortens the total\ntime to and from your destination.\nBecause of\nits\nrapid\nrate\nof\nclimb, the DC-9 reaches a\ncruising altitude in a few minutes, affording a\nsmooth, relaxing ride even on short trips.\nThe\nDC-9 iet carries its own loading steps and starting\ngenerator\nand can\nget in and out of smaller\nairports\nin ten minutes.\nThis new\nsilhouette\nsymbolizes another great step in Ozark's concept\nof service and dependability.\nGO-GETTERS GET UP AND GO WITH OZARK\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPOST CARD\n2015.166.2915"
    ],
